<% hotel_location = [@hotel.address, @hotel.city, @hotel.state, @hotel.country].reject(&:blank?).join(', ') %>
<% stay_window = "#{@reservation.check_in_date.strftime('%B %d, %Y')} to #{@reservation.check_out_date.strftime('%B %d, %Y')}" %>
<% cancellation_fee = number_to_currency(@cancellation_fee || 0) %>
<% paid_amount = number_to_currency(@reservation.paid_amount) %>
<% refund_amount = number_to_currency(@refund_amount || 0) %>
<% special_requests = @reservation.special_requests.presence || 'None recorded' %>

<%= @hotel.name %> Reservation Cancelled

Hello <%= @guest.full_name %>,

This email confirms that reservation <%= @reservation.confirmation_number %> at <%= @hotel.name %> has been cancelled.

Hotel: <%= @hotel.name %>
Location: <%= hotel_location.presence || 'Details on file' %>

Original Stay: <%= stay_window %> (<%= pluralize(@reservation.nights, 'night') %>)
Room Type: <%= @room_type.name %>
Guests: <%= pluralize(@reservation.total_guests, 'guest') %>

Payment Summary:
Amount Paid: <%= paid_amount %>
Cancellation Fee: <%= cancellation_fee %>
Refund Amount: <%= refund_amount %>

Special Requests on File:
<%= special_requests %>

If you have questions about this cancellation or the refund timeline, reply to this email or call <%= @hotel.phone.presence || 'the hotel' %>.

We hope to welcome you in the future.

<%= @hotel.name %>
<%= hotel_location.presence || '' %>
<%= @hotel.phone.presence || '' %>
<%= @hotel.email.presence || '' %>
